{"title":"1997 AIME Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_5_(Dangerous)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 5 (Dangerous)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AIME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Given a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Nonnegative\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Nonnegative\">nonnegative</a> real number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/8/9a8fa698c309a9d677f42fd793cb9c979a059694.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\langle x\\rangle$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"23\" height=\"19\" /> denote the fractional part of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />; that is, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/1/7213636c0e983ce515af0fea74dcacf9dd5c4ad1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\langle x\\rangle=x-\\lfloor x\\rfloor$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"105\" height=\"19\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/1/441416e660d25335f27e55334ac2a06e51541c97.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lfloor x\\rfloor$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"23\" height=\"19\" /> denotes the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Greatest_integer\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Greatest integer\">greatest integer</a> less than or equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />. Suppose that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is positive, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/1/8d1ac60064009e6b8f79d4f11c8ec0a954413f17.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\langle a^{-1}\\rangle=\\langle a^2\\rangle$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"95\" height=\"20\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/5/6158c43f0fa534638ffe2b0d28cd534a2f2578f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2&lt;a^2&lt;3$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"83\" height=\"15\" />. Find the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/2/842cb436fe18984549b59f0e0cf054be3e89c24c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^{12}-144a^{-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"102\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AIME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Looking at the properties of the number, it is immediately guess-able that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/2/ef238bb43d591e6f5f9959d6c6d1c2f5ceff33b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = \\phi = \\frac{1+\\sqrt{5}}2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"127\" height=\"41\" /> (the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Phi\" title=\"Phi\">golden ratio</a>) is the answer. The following is the way to derive that:\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/0/1201daa8405e966eee60fdc743ac951d0d33eb93.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{2} &lt; a &lt; \\sqrt{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"107\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/f/18f5387ba2d3cb2fa2a88b521c58fcdc04487fde.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 &lt; \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}} &lt; a^{-1} &lt; \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} &lt; 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"198\" height=\"41\" />. Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/d/61d30ea1075acd2bfe3a18613cdf2522778f5fb7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\langle a^2 \\rangle = a^{-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"81\" height=\"20\" />, and it follows that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/c/f0cf17777b53f0de1f1c8f232842e22c2d4a452b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2 - 2 = a^{-1} \\Longrightarrow a^3 - 2a - 1 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"261\" height=\"15\" />. Noting that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/e/bae5aba07d37ff6ff813107e76260fb31ad5794e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" /> is a root, this factors to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/f/bcf07180879763e98583cae4c6465d40ce20d868.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a+1)(a^2 - a - 1) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"182\" height=\"19\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/1/8b1906e022d3b7e84434d0db93a81fa2515bd569.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = \\frac{1 + \\sqrt{5}}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"92\" height=\"41\" /> (we discard the negative root).\n</p><p>Our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/d/e3df38df885cdca01a2dc73ac5075d4a9a2b35c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a^2)^{6}-144a^{-1} = \\left(\\frac{3+\\sqrt{5}}2\\right)^6 - 144\\left(\\frac{2}{1 + \\sqrt{5}}\\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"369\" height=\"56\" />. <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Complex_conjugate\" title=\"Complex conjugate\">Complex conjugates</a> reduce the second term to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/f/50f2a6decec298249ab2d542b4f67cdbdf71f92a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-72(\\sqrt{5}-1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"100\" height=\"21\" />. The first term we can expand by the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Binomial_theorem\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Binomial theorem\">binomial theorem</a> to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/a/62aa8e80c4243e48a71b0ddf01c0cf5151b98406.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac 1{2^6}\\left(3^6 + 6\\cdot 3^5\\sqrt{5} + 15\\cdot 3^4 \\cdot 5 + 20\\cdot 3^3 \\cdot 5\\sqrt{5} + 15 \\cdot 3^2 \\cdot 25 + 6 \\cdot 3 \\cdot 25\\sqrt{5} + 5^3\\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"601\" height=\"37\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/3/0e344a536a6eb2767a845ce7e1730d255da0ee50.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$= \\frac{1}{64}\\left(10304 + 4608\\sqrt{5}\\right) = 161 + 72\\sqrt{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"310\" height=\"37\" />. The answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/b/e2ba33924c83e4fbe1ecd84c99bdbf36fd67a510.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$161 + 72\\sqrt{5} - 72\\sqrt{5} + 72 = \\boxed{233}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"260\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p><p>Note that to determine our answer, we could have also used other properties of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/1/2c175f60eecef1de7560c3bdea495d69f26f719d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\phi$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"13\" height=\"18\" /> like <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/d/4ad0fe294d0ce2f2a372ae4f5276e39d54ad315d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\phi^3 = 2\\phi + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"92\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AIME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> as shown above. Note that, since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is a root of the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/6/5a6ee50302f8bfa8478d92e5b899865be7da57a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^3 - 2a - 1 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"122\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/1/ab1ae375cf1f2df97dcfe88de974fb532b74bf3c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^3 = 2a + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"93\" height=\"18\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/0/b100b773562701ecdf62d83201d025a2c0dad71e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^{12} = (2a + 1)^4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"118\" height=\"19\" />. Also note that, since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is a root of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/2/f5294d94462b6a4216bf22d47556b8f5677f37ad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2 - a - 1 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"113\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/2/062590e6da75d7f0c5aa7bafd1ae2ed62acd423d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{a} = a - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"77\" height=\"37\" />. The expression we wish to calculate then becomes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/a/f0aef7cae1ac05e47ee1e15fa69ee375fa857d79.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2a + 1)^4 - 144(a - 1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"174\" height=\"19\" />. Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/1/8b1906e022d3b7e84434d0db93a81fa2515bd569.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = \\frac{1 + \\sqrt{5}}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"92\" height=\"41\" />, we plug in to get an answer of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/7/cf78e2dc500f1e3e55e1a209371d5648a5d80e46.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(161 + 72\\sqrt{5}) + 72 - 72\\sqrt{5} = 161 + 72 = \\boxed{233}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"366\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AIME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> as shown above. Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> satisfies the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/a/6bab87e35e40a06b0e3a3fc2ce01563f033fe7e9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2 = a+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"81\" height=\"16\" /> (this is the equation we solved to get it). Then, we can simplify <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/8/ff8852f3d061a1ba5abc2895805a74fef3a27003.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^{12}$\" width=\"22\" height=\"15\" /> as follows using the fibonacci numbers:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/8/298d8141904deaff23d7c51ec257e93356dd3648.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^{12} = a^{11}+a^{10}= 2a^{10} + a^{9} = 3a^9+ 2a^8 = ... = 144a^1+89a^0 = 144a+89$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"581\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>So we want <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/9/a3993f82216983c2c89d6cde097bc3d05b174b06.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$144(a-\\frac1a)+89 = 144(1)+89 = \\boxed{233}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"307\" height=\"38\" /> since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/0/8c0230929287aea9b1a3c7a0ace1b01a967bf730.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a-\\frac1a = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"77\" height=\"37\" /> is equivalent to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/a/6bab87e35e40a06b0e3a3fc2ce01563f033fe7e9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2 = a+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"81\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AIME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>As Solution 1 stated, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/6/5a6ee50302f8bfa8478d92e5b899865be7da57a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^3 - 2a - 1 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"122\" height=\"15\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/7/2f7b8ae6f0c775a6123ebdec3bd30d5a949b0f9a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^3 - 2a - 1 = a^3 - a^2 -a + a^2 -a -1 = (a+1)(a^2 - a - 1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"480\" height=\"21\" />. So, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/2/f5294d94462b6a4216bf22d47556b8f5677f37ad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2 - a - 1 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"113\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/a/59a243f64e49be8fd6f00cc1af04e111e939f629.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 = a^2 - a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"84\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/6/60680efb4003f374b3ab36bbd33a1545f2db8f15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac1a = a-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"81\" height=\"38\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/b/38b31abe0752aa4e051fcb20da7fc4cec348d60e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^3 = 2a+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"93\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/a/6bab87e35e40a06b0e3a3fc2ce01563f033fe7e9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2 = a+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"81\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/f/65fd40fee4c45efc2a9110fbd6f76f071f923572.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^6 = (a^3)^2 = (2a+1)^2= 4a^2 + 4a +1= 4(a+1) + 4a + 1= 8a+5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"535\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/c/01cc92bbe5adeab3c5fa760a90b17d2132ee447e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^{12} = (a^6)^2 = (8a+5)^2 = 64a^2 + 80a + 25 = 64(a+1) + 80a + 25 = 144a + 89$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"624\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p>Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/1/e0154d930d3a36972e9589ad7c6e44afde6f6e18.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^{12} - 144 a^{-1} = 144a + 89 - 144(a-1) = 89 + 144 = \\boxed{233}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"463\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p><br />\nAnother way to factor <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/4/e344887b74fa653c03ebb301b0aa3b6f9a5101f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^3 - 2a - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"91\" height=\"18\" />:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/0/a10f54fc9ffe1b03e95d26e52ec108c9f8215b30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^3 - 2a - 1 = a^3 + 1 -2a -2 = (a+1)(a^2 - a + 1) - 2(a+1) = (a + 1)(a^2 - a - 1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"670\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p>~<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/User:Isabelchen\">isabelchen</a>\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_5_.28Dangerous.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_5_(Dangerous)\">Solution 5 (Dangerous)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AIME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 5 (Dangerous)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can estimate <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> to 3 decimal levels of precision by plugging it in to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/6/0367fa4e7af7c64e72107f006d3f7602a29d62c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^3 = 3a + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"93\" height=\"18\" /> (insane bash) when we get a is slightly below <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/c/bacb5fa0e144d285dc8a7f3576742e9bf58eb083.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1.62$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"34\" height=\"14\" />. We then use <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/6/0367fa4e7af7c64e72107f006d3f7602a29d62c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^3 = 3a + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"93\" height=\"18\" /> to manipulate what we want to get ( which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/b/efb5fd2957a4b1442826a8e8bf88640d404a33a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$88(a - a^2) + 321$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"133\" height=\"21\" /> and by plugging <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/0/7b08787a283aaa01f40ed6d95d32cfa2a2007549.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1.61$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"34\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/c/bacb5fa0e144d285dc8a7f3576742e9bf58eb083.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1.62$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"34\" height=\"14\" /> to in make sense for the answer to be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/8/898449ac622cdb623cbef74e26c03df7f2bf6c56.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{233}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"40\" height=\"25\" /> rather than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/5/815c3c71386b6a6a5d2b338754331461641cc8d7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$234$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"27\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p>Sidenote: I was really stupid and did not factor the cubic correctly because I thought it was not factorable. So do not bash it out this way.\n</p><p>~Aarav22\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AIME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AIME\" title=\"1997 AIME\">1997 AIME </a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AIME_Problems\" title=\"1997 AIME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AIME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1997 AIME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=1997\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AIME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1997 AIME Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AIME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1997 AIME Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AIME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1997 AIME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AIME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1997 AIME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AIME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1997 AIME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AIME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1997 AIME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AIME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1997 AIME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AIME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1997 AIME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AIME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1997 AIME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"